FRONTEND_PROMPT.md

# GENERATED from BUG-HISTORY.md by backend/scripts/gen-bug-index.mjs.
# NOT tracked: every PR must append to BUG-HISTORY.md and merges are strictly
# serial, so a committed copy conflicts on every pair of concurrent PRs — all
# 50 of the last 50 commits touched it. `audit:bug-index` regenerates and gates
# on the generator working, which needs no copy in git.
docs/generated/bug-index.md
